cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "xcquinox: machine-learned exchange-correlation functionals in JAX"
abstract: >-
  Neural exchange and correlation enhancement factors trained against reference densities and
  energies through a differentiable self-consistent field, with a research pipeline for
  pretraining against a parent functional, training with energy, potential and density
  channels, held-out evaluation over standard benchmark pools, and a SLURM harness that
  drives a campaign from one configuration file.
type: software
authors:
